    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. but if we follow that logic, wouldn't it mean that the whole push for \"global cooperation\" and these big international treaties is actually kind of a flawed or outdated way to run things now? it seems like the era of putting global economic efficiency above a country's own security is basically over. would you say we're seeing the inevitable decline of the globalist era?",
